# PixiJS game conventions

- Use **PixiJS v8** (`Application.init`, `Assets`, `Graphics` chain API).
- One `Game` owns the app + shared systems; **Scenes** own genre logic.
- Register scenes with `game.scenes.register` / `change` — no global singletons for level state.
- Input: bind actions (`input.bind('jump', ['Space','KeyW'])`), never hardcode keys in entities.
- Load textures via `AssetSystem` aliases pointing at `/assets/...`.
- Prefer `Container` composition; use `Entity` only when an update hook helps.
- Keep fixed-timestep physics optional — if added, isolate under `src/game/systems/`.
- Target modern browsers; no Node APIs inside `src/`.
